{"id":"70714818ed137ea4","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-gl-canonical-truth.md","title":"GL Canonical Truth Lemma","display":"lem-gl-canonical-truth — GL Canonical Truth Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-gl-canonical-truth","aliases":["89-lem-gl-canonical-truth"],"display":"lem-gl-canonical-truth — GL Canonical Truth Lemma","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-canonical-model]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-gl-canonical-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-gl-canonical-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-gl-canonical-truth — GL Canonical Truth Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6f068c38418e21f2\" href=\"?note=6f068c38418e21f2\" title=\"89-df-gl-canonical-model\">89-df-gl-canonical-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}=(W_{\\mathrm{GL}},R_{\\mathrm{GL}},V_{\\mathrm{GL}})\">\\(\\mathcal{M}^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}=(W_{\\mathrm{GL}},R_{\\mathrm{GL}},V_{\\mathrm{GL}})\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in W_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(S\\in W_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\nA\\in S\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal{M}^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}},S\\models A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\nA\\in S\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal{M}^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}},S\\models A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>规范真值引理是完全性证明的核心</li>\n<li>规范真值引理保证语义和语法的对应</li>\n<li>规范真值引理是模态逻辑的标准结果</li>\n<li>该真值引理只陈述典范模型中的成员关系；它不声称\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathcal M^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 的整个框架逆良基。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-canonical-model","status":"resolved","id":"6f068c38418e21f2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-canonical-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}=(W_{\\mathrm{GL}},R_{\\mathrm{GL}},V_{\\mathrm{GL}})","display":false},{"tex":"S\\in W_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\nA\\in S\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal{M}^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}},S\\models A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal M^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false}],"bytes":982,"backlinks":[{"id":"570349aa538831d0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["6f068c38418e21f2","9f00301866fbd6f0"]}